Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分在课程的 Colab 里做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 happens in the course Colab,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:04.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:08.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这一讲的 Ed 课程页面打开它，链接就在屏幕上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open it from the lecture's Ed lesson; the link is on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.17,0:00:13.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先点 File，再点 Save a copy in Drive；原版是只读的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First: File, Save a copy in Drive; the original is view-only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:17.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后点 Runtime，再点 Change runtime type，选一个 GPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then: Runtime, Change runtime type, and pick a GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:19.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,免费的 T4 就够了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A free T4 is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:25.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 节 pin 住 transformers、bitsandbytes 和 trl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3 pins transformers, bitsandbytes and trl, and removes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:26.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并卸载 torchao\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}torchao, which,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:31.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,notebook 里说，有它在的话 peft 不肯添加 LoRA 层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the notebook notes, makes peft refuse to add LoRA layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:34.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 节需要一个免费的 Hugging Face token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 4 needs a free Hugging Face token:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Hugging Face 网站上打开 Settings\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on huggingface.co, open Settings,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再点 Access Tokens，建一个只读的 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then Access Tokens, make a read token,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:44.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,存进 Colab 的 Secrets，命名为 HF token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and save it in Colab secrets as HF_TOKEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:48.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 节导入这些库，打印版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 5 imports the libraries, prints the versions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:53.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时是 torch 2.11 和 transformers 5.16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the time of recording torch 2.11 and transformers 5.16,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.43,0:00:55.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后挂载你的 Drive\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and mounts your Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:58.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 节把两个模型都缓存到那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 6 caches both models there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完 Part A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run part A.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来看课上的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the lecture's question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么不干脆训练所有权重？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why not simply train all the weights?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:10.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,拿一个 100 亿参数、用 16 位浮点数存的模型来说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Take a model with 10 billion parameters in 16-bit floats:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,光是权重就要 20 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the weights alone take 20 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:25.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,梯度每个权重一个，又要 20 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gradients, one per weight, take another 20 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:29.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Adam 优化器还要给每个权重保留两个滑动平均\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the Adam optimizer keeps two running averages per weight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:32.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 32 位浮点数存：80 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in 32-bit floats: 80 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:40.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 120 GB，相当于五块 24 GB GPU 的显存，这还没算激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's 120 in total, the memory of five GPUs with 24 gigabytes each, before any activations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:46.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,LoRA 只训练小小的 adapter，所以梯度和优化器状态几乎没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}LoRA trains only small adapters, so gradients and optimizer states nearly vanish,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:50.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但冻结的基座还得待在显存里做前向传播\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the frozen base still sits in memory for the forward pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:53.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上估计这部分大约 40 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture puts that at about 40 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:59.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,QLoRA 把基座用 4 位存储，课上算出的总量降到大约 12 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}QLoRA stores the base in 4 bits, and the lecture's total drops to about 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:01.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来几章讲的就是这三根柱子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next chapters are those three bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,量化就是把一个区间分成若干个桶\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Quantization means splitting a range into buckets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.93,0:02:10.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只记下每个数落进了哪个桶\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and storing only which bucket a number fell into.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:15.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上先讲 LoRA；我们跟着 notebook 走，它先做量化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture builds LoRA first; we follow the notebook, which quantizes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:24.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 27、55.3 和 83.78 取整：27、55 和 84\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Round 27, 55.3 and 83.78 to whole numbers: 27, 55 and 84.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:27.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,取整到十位：30、60 和 80\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Round to tens: 30, 60 and 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:30.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,桶越少，需要的位数越少，丢掉的细节也越多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fewer buckets need fewer bits, and lose more detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的例题用的是 absmax\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's worked example uses absmax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:42.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 1.5 到 10.2 的十个数，都乘以 127 除以最大值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ten values from 1.5 to 10.2 are multiplied by 127 over the largest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:45.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 10.2 正好落在 127 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so 10.2 lands exactly on 127.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:53.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后每个数取整：1.5 变成 19，5.6 变成 70\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then each value rounds to an integer: 1.5 becomes 19, and 5.6 becomes 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:03:00.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再除回去，19 变成 1.526，70 变成 5.622\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Divide back, and 19 becomes 1.526, 70 becomes 5.622.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:06.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那些红色的小缺口就是反量化误差：量化总会丢一点东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those small red gaps are the dequantization error: quantization always loses a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上写的是 18 和 69；四舍五入应该是 19 和 70\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slide shows 18 and 69; rounding gives 19 and 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:14.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整个矩阵只用一个常数有风险\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One constant for a whole matrix is risky:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:18.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个很大的权重会挤掉其他所有权重的精度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one large weight squashes everyone else's precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:23.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 bitsandbytes 给每块 64 个权重单独存一个 absmax 常数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So bitsandbytes keeps one absmax constant per small block of 64 weights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:25.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,4 位能表示 16 个级别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four bits give 16 levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:30.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,权重呈钟形分布，所以 4 位 NormalFloat，也就是 NF4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Weights are bell-shaped, so 4-bit NormalFloat, NF4, puts them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:34.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把级别放在分位数上：零附近密，两端稀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at quantiles: dense near zero, sparse in the tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:39.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个权重存成一个 4 位的索引；两个正好装进一个字节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each weight is stored as a 4-bit index; two of them fit in one byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:44.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些每块的常数加起来也不少，所以双重量化把它们也量化了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those block constants add up, so double quantization quantizes them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:49.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上跳过了它；notebook 把它打开了，就在这里，NF4 旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture skips it; the notebook turns it on, right here, beside NF4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:54.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 4 位存，用 16 位算：每次做矩阵乘法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stored in 4 bits, computed in 16: for each matrix multiply,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:59.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一层的权重都会展开成一份 16 位的副本，用完就丢\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the layer's weights are expanded to a 16-bit copy, used, then dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:02.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上用 BF16 计算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture computes in BF16;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:07.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 用 FP16，训练那一章会解释原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook in FP16, as the training chapter explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:10.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part B 的第 1 节把小的 OPT 模型打印出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 1 of part B prints the small OPT model:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:13.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个线性层现在都是 Linear4bit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every linear layer is now Linear4bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:17.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 embedding 和输出头保持原样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}while the embeddings and the output head stay as they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:20.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 节还把一句话分词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 1 also tokenizes a short prompt,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:24.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 节生成我们前面见过的那段续写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and section 2 generates the continuation we met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:26.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完 Part B\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run part B.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:34.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两个误解要丢掉：4 位模型并不做 4 位运算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two misconceptions to drop: a 4-bit model does not do 4-bit arithmetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,省下来的是显存，不是速度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the win is memory, not speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:42.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part C 的第 1 步用同样的 4 位配方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part C, step 1, loads the real student,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载真正的学生模型 Qwen3 0.6B\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Qwen3 0.6B, with the same 4-bit recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:49.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着 prepare model for k-bit training\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then prepare_model_for_kbit_training freezes every weight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:52.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,冻结所有权重，并打开梯度检查点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and turns on gradient checkpointing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一个省显存的技巧，训练那一章会讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a memory trick the training chapter shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:05:01.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2.1 节数参数：3.758 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 2.1 counts the parameters: 375.8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:06.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可 Qwen3 0.6B 有 5.96 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But Qwen3 0.6B has 596 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:18.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,线性层里的 4.4 亿个权重\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 440 million weights in linear layers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:23.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每两个 4 位的值打包进一个字节，所以只算 2.2 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}are packed two 4-bit values to a byte, so they count as 220 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:29.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1.556 亿个 embedding 权重和归一化层都没有量化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 155.6 million embedding weights and the norms are not quantized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:33.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加起来：3.758 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add them up: 375.8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:37.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置在 2.2 里，确认用的是 NF4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The configuration, in 2.2, confirms NF4.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:42.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 2.3 里，基座模型续写一句话，写着写着就跑题了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In 2.3 the base model continues a sentence, and it drifts off topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:46.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 2.4 数可训练参数：0 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And 2.4 counts trainable parameters: zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:48.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全都冻结了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:51.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的第 3 步准备数据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook's step 3 prepares the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:56.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它下载一个 23 MB 的文件，从中抽取 1000 组问答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It downloads a 23 megabyte file and samples 1,000 pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看一行：contents，user 这一轮，model 这一轮\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at a row: contents, a user turn, a model turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:05.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这和路线 A 的格式一模一样：第一部分的那块砖，到了这里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's exactly the format of track A: the brick from part 1 arrives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:09.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3.5 节让 tokenizer 写出 Qwen 的聊天模板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3.5 lets the tokenizer write Qwen's chat template:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:14.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,im start user，问题，im end，im start assistant\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}<|im_start|>user, the question, <|im_end|>, <|im_start|>assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个空的 think 块，然后是回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an empty think block, and the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:22.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,空的 think 块就是 Qwen3 不思考、直接回答的方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The empty think block is how Qwen3 answers without thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:24.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,之后聊天也用同样的前缀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and chat uses the same prefix later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:33.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3.6 节分出 900 个训练、100 个测试，3.7 检查一个样本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3.6 splits 900 for training and 100 for testing, and 3.7 checks one example.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:35.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后这条带子变成整数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the ribbon becomes integers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:39.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 覆盖每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the loss covers every token, question and template included.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说到底还是预测下一个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's still next-word prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:52.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数高效微调只训练一小部分，其余的冻结\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Parameter-efficient fine-tuning trains a small part and freezes the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:58.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把这些方法分成三大类：加性、选择性和重参数化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture sorts the methods into three families: additive, selective and reparameterization.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,LoRA 属于重参数化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}LoRA is a reparameterization.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先从小的说起\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start small.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:06.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 5 乘 5 的矩阵有 25 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A 5 by 5 matrix has 25 numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:09.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 5 乘 1 的列乘以一个 1 乘 5 的行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A 5 by 1 column times a 1 by 5 row
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:14.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也能得到 5 乘 5 的矩阵，只用 10 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}also makes a 5 by 5 matrix, from only 10 numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是秩为 1；秩为 2 需要 20 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's rank 1; rank 2 needs 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个尺寸上，几乎省不了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At this size it's barely a saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:21.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了真实尺寸，就不一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At real size it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:28.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Qwen 的 query 投影，是 2048 乘 1024 的矩阵：200 多万个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Qwen's query projection is a 2,048 by 1,024 matrix: over 2 million numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:32.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩为 8 的一对细条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A rank 8 pair of strips,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:38.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,2048 乘 8 和 8 乘 1024，一共 24576 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}2,048 by 8 and 8 by 1,024, holds 24,576.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:43.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 LoRA 分解的是更新量，不是权重\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So LoRA decomposes the update, not the weights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:47.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的这一层，就是冻结的 W₀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The new layer is the frozen W₀,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 alpha 除以 r，再乘以 B 乘 A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus α/r, times B times A.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:51.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只训练 B 和 A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only B and A are trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,B 从 0 开始，A 随机初始化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}B starts at zero and A at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:08:00.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上从正态分布里取 A；这个库用的是均匀分布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws A from a normal distribution; the library uses a uniform one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:04.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关键是 B 乘 A 一开始正好是 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What matters is that B times A starts at exactly zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以第 0 步的模型就是预训练的那个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so at step zero the model is the pretrained one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个分支的输出相加\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both branches' outputs add.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:15.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是 notebook 的第 4 步，LoRA 配置：alpha 16，秩 8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the notebook's step 4, the LoRA config: alpha 16 and rank 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:21.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以更新量缩放 2 倍，再加上 0.1 的 dropout 做正则化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the update is scaled by 2, plus a dropout of 0.1 for regularization.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪些层？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which layers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:29.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置里没有写 target modules。所以对 Qwen3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The config names no target_modules. So for Qwen3,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:34.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,PEFT 库的默认设置改的是 query 投影和 value 投影\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the PEFT library's default adapts the query and value projections:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:38.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,28 层里每一层七个矩阵中的两个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two of the seven matrices in each of the 28 blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:46.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是每层 40960 个，一共 1146880 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's 40,960 per block, 1,146,880 in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:50.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的表把整个模型当成一个方形的层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's table treats a whole model as one square layer;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真实的数量取决于这些形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the real count depends on these shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在，你自己试试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now, try it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:09.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩为 16 会翻倍，变成 2293760\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rank 16 doubles it, to 2,293,760.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:15.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,七个投影矩阵全用秩 8，是 5046272\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All seven projections at rank 8 give 5,046,272.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:19.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩越大，容量越大，代价是更多的显存和时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}More rank buys capacity at more memory and time;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:23.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,做人设的话，两个投影矩阵上用秩 8 就够了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for a persona, rank 8 on two projections is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:26.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要试的话，先在 1.3 重新加载模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To try it, reload the model in 1.3 first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:32.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到显存柱，按 Qwen 的大小，用我们自己的估算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to the memory column, at Qwen's size, by our own estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:37.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全参数微调大约要 7 GB，还没算激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Full fine-tuning would need about 7 gigabytes before activations;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:39.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的 QLoRA，不到 1 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook's QLoRA, under 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:44.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数只有 6 亿的话，就算全参数微调，也放得进一块 T4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At 0.6 billion parameters, even full fine-tuning would fit a T4.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这套配方之所以重要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The recipe matters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:49.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是因为同一个 notebook 能扩展到放不进去的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the same notebook scales to models that wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:53.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,剩下的显存给了激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The rest of the memory goes to activations,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:58.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是每一层在前向时算出来的值，留给反向传播用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the values each layer computes on the way forward, kept for the backward pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,梯度检查点只保留少数几个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gradient checkpointing keeps only a few
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:04.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其余的在需要时重新计算：用计算换显存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and recomputes the rest when needed: compute traded for memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.2 节，训练参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 4.2, the training arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:12.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,序列最长 512 个 token，按长度分组\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Sequences are capped at 512 tokens and grouped by length:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:18.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,2 个 epoch，batch 大小为 4，学习率是 2 乘 10 的负 4 次方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}2 epochs, batches of 4, and a learning rate of 2 times 10 to the minus 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:21.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,优化器是分页的 32 位 Adam\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The optimizer is a paged 32-bit Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:27.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,分页会在 GPU 显存满了的时候，把优化器状态挪到 CPU 内存里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paging moves optimizer state to CPU memory when the GPU fills up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的用不着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours never needs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:34.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打开 fp16，关掉 bf16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then fp16 on and bf16 off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:38.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,BF16 保留了 FP32 的范围但精度低一些\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}BF16 keeps the range of float 32 with less precision,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上做 QLoRA 用的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the lecture uses it for QLoRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:47.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,T4 没有快速的 BF16，所以这个 notebook 用 FP16 计算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The T4 has no fast BF16, so this notebook computes in FP16.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:49.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.3 节构建 trainer\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4.3 builds the trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:53.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 trainer 会把 adapter 转成 BF16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trainer turns the adapters into BF16,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:59.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 FP16 训练处理不了 BF16，所以这个单元格把它们转回 FP32\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which FP16 training cannot handle, so this cell casts them back to float 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:03.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这个数字证实了我们的算术\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the count confirms our arithmetic:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:08.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1146880 个可训练参数，占 0.3%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1,146,880 trainable parameters, 0.3 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:15.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在反向传播里，梯度会往下穿过 W₀，只有 B 和 A 被更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the backward pass, the gradient flows down through W₀, and only B and A are updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:20.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,W₀ 在往下传的时候会用到；只是它得不到梯度，也不会被更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}W₀ is used on the way down; it just gets no gradient and no update.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:25.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.4 节，训练：900 个样本，batch 大小为 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4.4, train: 900 examples in batches of 4
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:28.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑 2 个 epoch，就是 450 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for 2 epochs is 450 steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:33.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在保存的 A100 运行里用了 3 分 36 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}3 minutes and 36 seconds on the saved A100 run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 说，在 T4 上要 6 到 7 分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook says 6 to 7 minutes on a T4.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:40.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 从 2.0 降到了 1.35\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loss falls from 2.0 to 1.35.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:44.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有第 4.5 节，TensorBoard 会在你自己的运行里显示这些曲线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And 4.5, TensorBoard, shows these curves in your own run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:46.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，开始训练\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and train.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:53.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有效吗？第 5.1 节来衡量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Did it work? Section 5.1 measures it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:57.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,困惑度就是平均每个 token 的 loss 取指数，大致相当于\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Perplexity is the exponential of the average token loss:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:12:01.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型在多少个等可能的下一个 token 里做选择\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}roughly how many equally likely next tokens the model is choosing among.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:06.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 100 个测试样本、30681 个 token 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On 100 test examples, 30,681 tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:13.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,基座模型的 loss 是 2.65，困惑度 14.15\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the base model has a loss of 2.65 and a perplexity of 14.15.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:18.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的模型：loss 1.39，困惑度 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fine-tuned model: 1.39, and a perplexity of 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:22.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,基座那一行，就是同一个模型放在 disable adapter 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The base row is the same model inside disable_adapter().
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:29.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 adapter 关掉，原来的 4 位模型就回来了，因为 W₀ 从来没变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Switch the adapter off and the original model, in 4 bits, is back, because W₀ never changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:35.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这正是课上讲灾难性遗忘时的要点，也就是学新本事时丢了旧本事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's point about catastrophic forgetting, losing old skills while learning new ones:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:38.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 LoRA 的话，原来的模型只差一个开关\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with LoRA, the old model is one switch away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:42.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在保存的运行里，基座模型的每个回答都以 The 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the saved run, every base answer starts with the word The.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:45.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的回答以 welcome 或 Yello 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fine-tuned ones start with welcome or Yello,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:47.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是它训练数据里的开场白\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the openers of its training data.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:52.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那些柱子只是示意；实测的数字就在旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those bars are an illustration; the measured numbers sit beside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:54.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个下降衡量的是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does the drop measure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:58.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 算的是每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loss counts every token, questions and template included.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:03.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它说明这种风格是模型现在预期的，而不是它的回答更正确了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It says this style is what the model now expects, not that its answers are more correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:06.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5.2 节比较回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}5.2 compares answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:10.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个奶酪问题的回答现在都用授课老师的口吻开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both cheese answers now open with welcome welcome welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:12.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,welcome welcome welcome, cheese lovers\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}cheese lovers, in the instructor's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:16.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看天空：口吻学过去了，物理没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the sky: the voice transferred, the physics did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完第 5 节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run section 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两点友情提示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two kind notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:25.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这次比较里，基座是一个全新的 16 位模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this comparison the base is a fresh 16-bit model,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:29.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是表里那个 4 位的，所以两个基线不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the 4-bit one from the table, so the baselines differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.09,0:13:35.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另外，课上展示了 LoRA 在一个公开的基准测试上追平全参数微调\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the lecture shows LoRA matching full fine-tuning on a published benchmark;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:38.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 衡量的是风格契合度，不是回答质量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook measures style fit, not answer quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:42.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的第 6 步保存你的成果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook's step 6 saves your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:50.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先存 adapter：1146880 个数，用 FP32 存大约 4.6 MB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First the adapters: 1,146,880 numbers, about 4.6 megabytes in float 32,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:54.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,连同 tokenizer 一起存到你的 Drive\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}saved to your Drive with the tokenizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:00.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是合并\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:04.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 加载一份全新的 16 位基座副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook loads a fresh 16-bit copy of the base and adds
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 B 乘 A 加进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}B times A into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:11.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是加进 4 位的权重里：在那里，更新量会被舍入回 16 个级别上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not into the 4-bit weights: there, the update would round back onto 16 levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:14.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,合并后的模型大约 1.2 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The merged model is about 1.2 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:17.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果合并时报 torchao 的导入错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If the merge raises a torchao ImportError,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:21.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就重新运行安装单元格，再重启会话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}rerun the install cell and restart the session.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:26.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6.3 节可以把合并后的模型 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 6.3 can push the merged model
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:29.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到一个私有的 Hugging Face repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to a private Hugging Face repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以你可以交付三样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So you can ship three things:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:35.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个离不开基座的 adapter，一个能独立运行的合并模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an adapter that needs its base, a merged model that stands alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者 Google 的 endpoint，权重不在你手里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or Google's endpoint, with no weights in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:44.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,清理。退出 container，用 docker image rm 删掉两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Teardown. Exit the container and remove both images with docker image rm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉你的 bucket 里的数据集目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete the dataset folder in your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:52.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的模型和 endpoint 留到第 10 讲，之后再删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep the tuned model and endpoint for lecture 10, then delete them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:57.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉没用的服务账号密钥，再断开并删除 Colab 运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete unused service account keys, and disconnect and delete the Colab runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它们都清理掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and tear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:02.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.99,0:15:05.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改 prompt 和做检索，变的是输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prompts and retrieval change the input;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:09.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调变的是权重，而这里它教会的是口吻，不是事实\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}fine-tuning changes the weights, and here it taught a voice, not facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:14.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 A 里，教师模型写数据，Google 微调模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track A, a teacher wrote the data and Google tuned the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:17.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 B 里，QLoRA 冻结了一个 4 位的基座\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track B, QLoRA froze a 4-bit base
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:23.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只训练两个细细的矩阵：120、40，再到 12 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and trained two thin matrices: 120, then 40, then 12 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:29.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五道题，自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five questions to test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:32.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次微调改变了什么，没改变什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What did this fine-tune change, and what not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:35.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么 generate 在没有密钥时退出码也是 0？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why did generate exit zero without a key?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:38.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一组问答在变成模板的路上，要经过哪些形状？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which shapes does one pair take on its way to the template?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:41.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么 train 打印出来的是：Tuned model info: None？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does train print Tuned model info: None?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:46.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，1146880 是怎么来的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And where does 1,146,880 come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，第 9 讲测试代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, lecture 9 tests code,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:54.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10 讲会有一个应用调用你的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in lecture 10 an app calls your endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:59.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学习指南和练习都在 MLOps Learning 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The study guide and the exercises are in MLOps_Learning.
